#subtitle: Setting the party's ideological direction.

= Questions of Ideology

The KPD is torn between many different ideological currents. What should be our primary ideological guidance for now?

[? if ideology != 0 : We have previously chosen a [+ ideology +] ideology. ?]

- @ultra_left: Our party should launch immediate revolutions, follow the directives of Moscow, and attack democratic forces.
- @left_opposition: Following Leon Trotsky, we should support the "United Front" ideal, fight Stalinism, and restore workers' councils.
- @conciliator: The "middle ground" of Ernst Meyer remains the best way to resolve our internal contradictions.
- @right: We should form a "United Front" with other left-wing parties, and expand our electorate to nationalistic workers.
- @easy_discard

@ultra_left
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "ultra-left") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "ultra-left"; ultra-left_strength += 10; communist_coalition -= 1; ultra-left_dissent -= 5; z_relation -= 3; dvp_relation -= 5; nationalization_support += 1; spd_relation -= 3

The radical ultra-left of our party supports immediate revolution, fighting against pro-democratic parties, and loyalty to Stalin.

@left_opposition
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "centrist") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "left opposition"; left-opposition_strength += 10; ultra-left_dissent += 10; conciliator_dissent -= 5; communist_coalition += 1;

The Left Opposition supports Leon Trotsky and a temporary "United Front" against fascism, while striving for total communism later.

@conciliator
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "conciliator") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "conciliator"; conciliator_strength += 10; conciliator_dissent -= 5; communist_coalition += 1;

The conciliator wing of the party is open to considering the United Front, but does not openly criticize Stalin or the ultra-left. 

@right
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "right") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "right"; right_strength += 10; right_dissent -= 5; spd_relation += 5; z_relation += 5; communist_coalition += 2

The reformist wing of the party seeks to take a pragmatic approach in fighting facism, and is most supportive of coalitions with the other left-wing parties.

@changed
on-arrival: ultra-left_dissent += 1

We have changed ideologies. This is a common event in the KPD.
